OL,3,ARussia-bound ship attacked in Gulf of
OL,4,AFinland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian cargo vessel bound for the
OL,7,Fcountry's Baltic Kaliningrad territory
OL,8,Fhas been hit by a drone attack in the
OL,9,Feastern Gulf of Finland, Russian and
OL,10,FFinnish authorities say.
OL,12,FThe ship - the Sparta II - caught on
OL,13,Ffire after the strike on Saturday, and
OL,14,Fdrifted into Finnish waters. Finnish
OL,15,Fdefence forces said Ukraine was likely
OL,16,Fbehind the attack.
OL,18,F"War is spilling over into our
OL,19,Fimmediate vicinity," Finnish Prime
OL,20,FMinister Petteri Orpo said, adding:
OL,21,F"Ukraine has the right to fight back
OL,22,Fagainst the aggressor."
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
