OL,3,ARussia-bound ship attacked in Gulf of
OL,4,AFinland
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaliningrad Governor Alexei
OL,7,FBesprozvannykh said two drones were
OL,8,Fused, according to preliminary
OL,9,Finformation, and that there is "no
OL,10,Fthreat" to their supplies.
